      "schema:name": "The consulted source reports that the volume of traffic in the Mediterranean exerted an irresistible attraction on pirates, and as Braudel noted, the prosperity of piracy between Gibraltar and the Levant can be considered an indicator of the economic vitality of the region as much as the political disorder that reigned",
